            "expectedOutput": "<div class=\"status\">\n  <span class=\"online\">🟢 Online</span>\n  <span class=\"badge\">5</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"status\">\n  <span class=\"offline\">⚪ Offline</span>\n  \n</div>",
