              "fixedCode": "// ✅ Single Source of Truth + Derived Calculations:\nconst [tasks, setTasks] = useState([]);\n// Calculate on the fly during render:\nconst completedCount = tasks.filter(t => t.done).length;\nconst percentDone = tasks.length > 0 ? (completedCount / tasks.length) * 100 : 0;",
