          "answer": 1,
          "explanation": "Failing fast saves runner minutes and provides instant feedback to developers before provisioning and seeding containerized databases.",
          "remediation": "Structure CI pipelines with cheap verification gates (lint, tsc) preceding heavier service integration suites."
