        "content": "### Year 1 Capstone Milestone & Practicum Semantics\n\nMonth 12 concludes the first year of PinIT Career OS, culminating in the award of the:\n🎓 **PinitCareer Professional Certificate — Full-Stack Software Engineering (12-Month Program)**.\n\n#### Credential Taxonomy & Truth in Advertising\n* **`INDUSTRY_SIMULATION` / `VERIFIED_PRACTICUM`:** Rigorous internal simulation of enterprise client specifications with automated CI testing, code review rubrics, and viva examination.\n* **`VERIFIED_INTERNSHIP`:** Strictly reserved for verified engagements with legally separate third-party employers.\n* **Rule:** The 12-Month milestone is designated as **PinitCareer Industry Simulation & Practicum Gate**, maintaining absolute integrity and zero misleading claims.\n\n---\n\n### The Capstone Application: Audited Enterprise Asset & Timesheet Ledger\n\nThe capstone synthesizes all competencies mastered across Months 01–12:\n1. **Frontend Tier (React SPA):** Form state management, optimistic balance updates, protected route navigation, RFC 9457 error boundaries, and `X-CSRF-Token` header transmission.\n2. **Application Tier (Node.js / Express 5):** Zod runtime schema validation, connection pool management, Argon2id password hashing, session fixation rotation, session-bound double-submit CSRF validation, and RFC 9457 problem detail error formatting.\n3. **Database Tier (Native PostgreSQL):** 3NF normalized schema, foreign key referential integrity with explicit actions (`ON DELETE RESTRICT`), check constraints, B-Tree index optimization, transactional balance decrement with row locks (`SELECT ... FOR UPDATE`), and transactional migrations.\n\n```\n┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                               CAPSTONE INTEGRATION MATRIX                              │\n├──────────────────────────┬─────────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────┤\n│ Tier                     │ Responsibilities            │ Security & Reliability Controls│\n├──────────────────────────┼─────────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────┤\n│ React SPA                │ Reactive UI & State         │ Route UX, CSRF Header Attach  │\n│ Express 5 API            │ Request & Auth Gatekeeper   │ Zod Parse, Argon2id, RBAC     │\n│ PostgreSQL 18            │ Persistent Truth Engine     │ 3NF, MVCC, Row Locks, WAL     │\n└──────────────────────────┴─────────────────────────────┴───────────────────────────────┘\n```",
