            "initialCode": "// Simulation: Clock Skew Trap in Naive Last-Write-Wins (LWW)\nfunction resolveLwwWithClockDrift(opA, opB) {\n  // opA occurred at True Time 10:00:00, but client A clock was 5s fast (10:00:05)\n  // opB occurred at True Time 10:00:02, with accurate clock (10:00:02)\n  const winner = opA.clientTime > opB.clientTime ? opA : opB;\n  return {\n    winner: winner.id,\n    expectedWinner: 'opB (true later edit)',\n    anomaly: winner.id !== 'opB' ? 'DATA_LOSS_DUE_TO_CLOCK_DRIFT' : 'CORRECT'\n  };\n}\n\nconst opA = { id: 'opA', value: 'Draft A', clientTime: 10005 };\nconst opB = { id: 'opB', value: 'Draft B', clientTime: 10002 };\nconsole.log('LWW Conflict Resolution:', resolveLwwWithClockDrift(opA, opB));",
            "expectedOutput": "LWW Conflict Resolution: {\n  winner: 'opA',\n  expectedWinner: 'opB (true later edit)',\n  anomaly: 'DATA_LOSS_DUE_TO_CLOCK_DRIFT'\n}",
