            "As best-effort memory hygiene to overwrite the sensitive cryptographic key in the buffer immediately after use and minimize its exposure lifetime in process memory.",
            "Because zeroing the buffer automatically re-encrypts the database record on disk.",
            "To prove that the AES cipher key was derived from prime numbers."
