            "expectedOutput": "=== SET search_path (Session-Scoped) ===\nExecutes on Client Socket -> Persists across all subsequent transactions on that socket\n=== SET LOCAL search_path (Transaction-Scoped) ===\nExecutes within BEGIN...COMMIT -> Automatically resets to default search_path upon COMMIT/ROLLBACK",
