        "content": "### Synthesizing 24 Months of Engineering Invariants\nOver 117 days, we have constructed isolated systems primitives. Day 118 synthesizes these components into a unified enterprise topology:\n\n#### The Enterprise Technology Tiers\n1. **Edge Tier:** CloudFront CDN with TLS termination, origin shielding, and stale-while-revalidate caching.\n2. **Routing & Ingress Tier:** Layer 7 ALB enforcing HTTPS redirects and routing to private application subnets.\n3. **Application Compute Tier:** Containerized Node.js services executing on AWS ECS Fargate serverless microVMs under least-privileged unprivileged `USER node` execution.\n4. **Relational & Semantic Persistence:** PostgreSQL 18.6 Multi-AZ DB instances with `pgvector 0.8.6` co-location and database-enforced Row-Level Security.\n5. **In-Memory Caching & Distributed Coordination:** Shared Redis 8 cluster for sub-millisecond caching, Lua rate-limiting, and ephemeral presence leases.\n6. **Asynchronous Processing:** BullMQ workers consuming from a Transactional Outbox with atomic lease-recovery and fencing tokens.\n7. **Object Storage:** Amazon S3 with Block Public Access and client-direct pre-signed SigV4 upload URLs.",
